   "updated": 1764000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "TOOLS (all free, safe licences)\n\nDocling: understands headings and table structure\nFast path / backup: MarkItDown, python-docx, openpyxl, python-pptx\nOCR: RapidOCR on the laptop CPU (about 3-4 s per page, 100% on our test)\nAI vision: about $0.001 per page, any vision model (not tied to Gemini)",
   "originalText": "TOOLS (all free, safe licences)\n\nDocling: understands headings and table structure\nFast path / backup: MarkItDown, python-docx, openpyxl, python-pptx\nOCR: RapidOCR on the laptop CPU (about 3-4 s per page, 100% on our test)\nAI vision: about $0.001 per page, any vision model (not tied to Gemini)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
